---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const updated = '4 November 2026';
---
<Base title="Privacy notice" path="/privacy/" description="How RED Project handles the personal data you send through redproject.id.">
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container legal__inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="h2">Privacy notice</h1>
      <p class="mono muted">Last updated {updated}</p>
      <div class="legal__body">
        <p>This notice explains what personal data {site.name} collects through this website and how we use it, in line with Indonesia's Personal Data Protection Law (UU No. 27 Tahun 2022).</p>
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>When you send a brief through the contact form, we receive the details you enter: your name, company, email address, WhatsApp number, the service you're interested in and your message. When you contact us on WhatsApp or by email, we receive what you send there.</p>
        <h2>Why we use it</h2>
        <p>We use these details only to reply to your enquiry and, if you choose to work with us, to prepare a proposal. We don't sell your data or add you to a mailing list without asking.</p>
        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>Enquiries are kept for up to 24 months so we can follow up on the conversation, then deleted. You can ask us to delete them sooner.</p>
        <h2>Who processes it</h2>
        <p>Form submissions are delivered by email through our web hosting provider, DomaiNesia. WhatsApp conversations are processed by WhatsApp (Meta) under its own terms.</p>
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal data we hold about you, or withdraw your consent, by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="link-underline red">{site.email}</a>.</p>
        <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>This website does not set advertising cookies. If we add analytics, we will update this notice before it goes live.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { padding-top: calc(var(--header-h) + clamp(48px, 8vw, 120px)); padding-bottom: var(--section); }
  .legal__inner { display: grid; gap: 20px; max-width: 860px; }
  .legal__body { display: grid; gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px; }
  .legal__body h2 { font-size: var(--step-1); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 16px; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
  .legal__body p { max-width: 68ch; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
